title: The host deletes a file in which a guest has text not saved, then the guest types on and saves: the file stays deleted and the guest's card goes away
folders: share-text
limit: 75
expect-log: share: share-text is shared, 4 files
absent-file: share-text\other.txt

wait 3000
share start writers
wait 9500
delete other.txt
wait 600
answer Delete
wait 4000
fit
wait 1200
mark host-after-deleting
wait 6000
fit
wait 1200
mark host-after-the-guest-saved
wait 3000
quit
wait 800
answer Close without saving
wait 1000
=== guest
wait 2500
share join {INVITE} Beto
wait 4000
goto other.txt
wait 1000
edit other.txt 2 1
key end
type by-beto.
wait 5500
mark after-the-host-deleted-it
wait 500
type more.
wait 400
key save
wait 2500
mark after-saving
wait 2500
quit
wait 1500
